# Lester Labs recovery configuration
#
# There are intentionally no frontend contract, RPC, or WalletConnect
# environment overrides. Transaction targets, runtime fingerprints, the
# LiteForge RPC, and the injected-only connector set are reviewed and pinned in
# source. The production build fails if a former NEXT_PUBLIC_* target override
# is present.
#
# Replacement addresses and runtimes must be generated from the independently
# verified production manifest with the clean-runner exporter, then committed
# as src/config/approvedPublicReplacement.json in the atomic reviewed cutover.
# Never put private keys, seed phrases, deployer credentials, or mutable
# transaction targets in this file or in the hosting environment.
